    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460 <strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You play as a social media reporter covering a string of mysterious serial deaths. <br>\u25cf According to witness accounts, all the victims encountered a woman with pink hair shortly before their deaths. <br>\u25cf Tracing a strange perfume found at every crime scene, you eventually come face-to-face with the enigmatic \u201cPink-Haired Woman.\u201d <br>\u25cf Is she the key suspect, or something even more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf To investigate the pink-haired woman, the protagonist repeatedly uses the perfume found at the crime scenes\u2014an act that mimics drug inhalation. <br>\u25cf Without using the perfume, you cannot progress in the game\u2014highlighting dependency. <br>\u25cf The game portrays the protagonist\u2019s gradual descent into addiction and the collapse of their personal life\u2014serving as a powerful warning about drug abuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no buttons respond while browsing a webpage about the &quot;Mirago Fruit&quot;, please press the &quot;F7&quot; key briefly once and then move your mouse over the &quot;Mirago Fruit&quot; icon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718920/extras/8b3e14255713fb49aa1439c71cc127d9.avif?t=1752763460\" width=465 height=363 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2460 <strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You play as a social media reporter covering a string of mysterious serial deaths. <br>\u25cf According to witness accounts, all the victims encountered a woman with pink hair shortly before their deaths. <br>\u25cf Tracing a strange perfume found at every crime scene, you eventually come face-to-face with the enigmatic \u201cPink-Haired Woman.\u201d <br>\u25cf Is she the key suspect, or something even more sinister?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2461 <strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf To investigate the pink-haired woman, the protagonist repeatedly uses the perfume found at the crime scenes\u2014an act that mimics drug inhalation. <br>\u25cf Without using the perfume, you cannot progress in the game\u2014highlighting dependency. <br>\u25cf The game portrays the protagonist\u2019s gradual descent into addiction and the collapse of their personal life\u2014serving as a powerful warning about drug abuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If no buttons respond while browsing a webpage about the &quot;Mirago Fruit&quot;, please press the &quot;F7&quot; key briefly once and then move your mouse over the &quot;Mirago Fruit&quot; icon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718920/extras/8b3e14255713fb49aa1439c71cc127d9.avif?t=1752763460\" width=465 height=363 /></span></p>",
